unity cost of delaying automated therapeutic design is measured in preventable disease progression and human suffering that adaptive computing pipelines are ready to solve right now. Every month of bureaucratic delay engineered by risk-averse agencies consigns real patients to diseases that dynamic protein models could otherwise neutralize. The burden of proof rests entirely on those who demand restrictions; they must justify the immediate, tangible body count of their theoretical safeguards against verifiable data from active deployment.",
